Add `transition operation` and `transition epoch-processing` subcommands.

Upstream's transition command covers blocks and slots, which leaves the
operations and epoch_processing suites of consensus-spec-tests unreachable.
Both new subcommands reuse processStateTransition, so they inherit the same
--pre/--post file handling as `transition blocks`, and dispatch on a type
argument to the matching BlockProcessor or EpochProcessor entry point.

`operation` also takes --execution-valid, which the execution_payload vectors
need: the official runner decides payload validity from the test case rather
than executing anything, and the optimistic executor here returns that flag.
